    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want small things. i don't want to \"break the paralysis\" with a walk or a cup of tea. that's just distraction. i feel like i'm just lingering here out of habit, but there's nothing left of me to actually do anything with. it's like i'm just waiting to catch up to him.",
